</div>

<div class="banner">{{ t(
  'Descriptive rank — not a forecast. Grade-weighted breadth (GW) = Σ w(grade) over buying funds − Σ w(grade) over selling funds, w: A=2, B=1.5, C=1, D/n·a=0.75. Every number on this board is 13F-lane on the filing-date clock; index ETFs excluded; nothing here blends with insider or short axes.',
  '描述性排名——并非预测。评级加权广度（GW）= 买入基金Σw(评级) − 卖出基金Σw(评级)，w：A=2、B=1.5、C=1、D/无评级=0.75。本板块所有数字均属13F通道、以申报日为时钟；已剔除指数ETF；不与内部人或空头视角混合。'
) }}</div>

