</div>

<div class="banner">{{ t(
  '13D deadline is 5 business days since Feb 2024 (was 10 calendar days). Custodial 13Gs (index giants) are classified as noise and collapsed by default.',
  '自2024年2月起，13D申报期限为5个工作日（此前为10个日历日）。指数巨头的被动13G申报被归类为噪音，默认折叠显示。'
) }}</div>

